        "biography": "Michael Jackman, also known as\u00a0Michael A. Jackman\u00a0and\u00a0Mike Jackman,\u00a0is an American film and television producer. He has produced films such as\u00a0The Good Nurse\u00a0(2022),\u00a0Greyhound\u00a0(2020),\u00a0Arrival\u00a0(2016),\u00a0Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\u00a0(2004), and more. He has worked with directors such as\u00a0Martin Scorsese\u00a0and\u00a0Denis Villeneuve throughout his career. He served as producer on the 2024 psychological thriller film\u00a0Conclave, based on\u00a0the 2016 novel\u00a0by\u00a0Robert Harris\u00a0and directed by\u00a0Edward Berger.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Michael Jackman (producer), licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.",
